# Installation Complete

The IDP Estate has been installed.

## Next steps

1. Open Terminal and run:

       /usr/local/bin/idp-install-all

   This installs Python 3.12, all packages, and configures services.

2. FleetView backend is running at: http://127.0.0.1:18790

## Uninstall

    sudo rm -rf /usr/local/idp /usr/local/bin/idp-install-all
    launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u)/ai.estate.fleetview-backend
